Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Celestial Realm is about to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must enter the Thunder Pool
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:43.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,to refine enough origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,pressure ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to the Thunder Pool ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Silver-horned Thunder Beast ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Illusory Yin puppet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's also a Thunder Celestial Messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he's only Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can he be unafraid of the Thunder Pool ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,With just a single glance,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.72,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1644,541)}Shengong Hu\NThunder Celestial Messenger\NIllusory Yin\N(Originally Corporeal Yang)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,my body and soul were damaged
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,and my Dao Heart was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.56,0:03:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,My cultivation even fell to Illusory Yin !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inside the Heaven Defying Bead,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had the immense opportunity of seeing the third step.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only caught a glimpse
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet have already gained such fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can fully open the Heaven Defying Door one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't even imagine...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gaze that nearly shattered my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be the legendary Dao Sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I could follow him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:07.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,this would be the greatest opportunity of my life !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I pay respects to Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior's name is Shengong Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm a member of the Shengong Family of the Southern Domain of Allheaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:18.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm also a rank 2 Thunder Celestial Messenger
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I used to be Corporeal Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg Senior
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:23.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,to allow me to pledge myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pledge ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.72,Third,,0,0,0,,knows his cultivation is still shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,He was frightened by the pressure of my comprehension,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.48,Third,,0,0,0,,I am not qualified to rely on Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's why he's saying all this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.00,Third,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.40,Third,,0,0,0,,There are many cultivation families that rely on their younger generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't perform it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.72,Third,,0,0,0,,If Senior has any requests,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Shengong Hu has already reached Corporeal Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.56,Third,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to fulfill them !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:42.12,Third,,0,0,0,,The heavens can bear witness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.16,Third,,0,0,0,,to Junior's sincerity !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:42.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he sees through my bluff one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,it could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only ask that Senior
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,offers a few words of guidance when I am about to breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior is willing to offer his Dao Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,along with his Dao Heart as proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:04:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to allow me to pledge myself for a thousand years !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's even offering his Dao Soul !?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,With his Dao Soul in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't need to fear him turning on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy is pretty decisive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't regret this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:16.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior will never regret it !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Celestial Realm is about to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior plans to cultivate here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to absorb origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not from Allheaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know when the Thunder Celestial Realm will open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,In about 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,By then, one can enter with a Thunder Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 years ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Rain Celestial Realm back then
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,laid the foundation for my campaign across the star systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must visit the Thunder Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are the cultivation restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.28,0:05:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,for entering the Thunder Celestial Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Peak Late stage Ascendant and below
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,are allowed to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:03.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the Thunder Celestial Temple has a secret method
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,to allow second step cultivators
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,to also enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, while inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,they mustn't use spells above Early stage Nirvana Scryer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,or else
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:14.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will trigger the collapse of the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,70 steps !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:30.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,80 steps !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,95 steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,100 steps !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,He walked 100 steps forward
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,as if it were nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior is indeed an expert who has concealed his cultivation !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gamble I made
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,was correct !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,my limit is 10 steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I were at my peak cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,50 steps wouldn't have been a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:25.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,When fighting Thunder Daoist,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I used the Heavenly Chop too many times
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and nearly exhausted my origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:32.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,For first step cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,replenishing origin energy is incredibly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, with my Thunder Origin Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can use the Thunder Origin Spell to convert this thunder energy into origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must recover as quickly as possible !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the 100-steps mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's still absorbing such a massive amount of thunder energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it were me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Origin Soul would have been severely damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior's cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,is unfathomable !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(152,444)}2 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:06.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the edge of the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,the thunder is sparse and impure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only at the middle of it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,will I be able to refine purer origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,To recover quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must go deeper !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,He moved !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior is finally going to move again !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:25.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those 2 years of waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,were just for this moment !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can catch even a glimpse of Senior's spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The thunder energy here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:08:59.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,is astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 steps...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior moved again
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,but how could he only walk 10 steps ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could that terrifying aura from before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,have been a coincidence ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:09:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then my pledge
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,would become the greatest joke of all time !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even with all my strength, I still can't reach the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:08.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Origin Soul shares the same origin as thunder,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,there must be a way to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same origin, yet repelled ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the key is not strength
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,All phenomena in the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,originate from within oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it's not a matter of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's a matter of alignment with the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only when the Dao is aligned can origin energy be absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:10:57.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:10:59.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,stepped on a thunderbolt ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The thunder became his steps
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,as if it was welcoming him !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the true pinnacle of the Dao of Thunder !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I waited 2 years
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:09.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,to see
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,what kind of spell my Lord would use !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,A glimpse at the third step...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,A comprehension of the Dao...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it wasn't offensive power,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's far more precious
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,than countless spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,sure is lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:42.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhan Konglie !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:47.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1578,504)}Zhan Konglie\NThunder Celestial Messenger\NCorporeal Yang
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Late stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,can actually enter the inner Thunder Pool ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,He must possess some extraordinary artifact to resist the thunder !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:58.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:11:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wondered who it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's Shengong Hu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,My eyesight is poor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't recognize you at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,has dropped quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This young friend looks unfamiliar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be able to sit safely in the inner pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.84,0:12:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must have a rare artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take it out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and let me have a look ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:24.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're doomed !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,A disaster has fallen from the sky !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This guy means trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we get exposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,everything will be over...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Corporeal Yang cultivation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man believes I possess a powerful artifact...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,He will not let this go easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,In order to show me his loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu will surely defend me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Earlier, due to the disparity in cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had to go along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,But today, with my Lord by my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,why should I fear him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:54.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have 3 breaths
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,to scram
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,or you'll die !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:01.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're willing to fight to the death with me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the sake of an Ascendant with an artifact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,what kind of game are you playing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhan Konglie,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.84,0:13:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,prepare to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll see this through to the end !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,what you're really up to !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're fighting !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Shen Gong Hu's cultivation dropped,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,he definitely won't hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Shengong Hu loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will fall into Zhan Konglie's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I retreat now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu will be suspicious of me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it will also put me in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:13:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not help you in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Consider it a test of your pledge to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will return your Dao Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rest assured my Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:11.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu will not disgrace your name !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.36,0:14:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lord ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,To monopolize the artifact,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,you've staged such a clumsy act with this kid
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,just to try to scare me, Zhan Konglie ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a joke !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a powerful thunder-summoning spell !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,He used origin energy to summon heavenly thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's like the Furnace Becomes the World spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,His mastery of the spell
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,seems incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Something isn't harmonious in this spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've found the way out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:16.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:46.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've always hated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,After testing you today,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.72,0:16:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you do have some skill after all !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.68,0:16:25.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,your origin spell contained the power of thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,but not the soul of thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although your Dao Heart fused with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,it isn’t enough. Your faith lacks the power of thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:36.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Lord is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is Junior's bottleneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg my Lord for guidance !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:43.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Merging the Dao Heart with thunder...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,who doesn't know that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.16,0:16:46.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the cultivation path is uncertain,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one truly knows the direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Anyone can spout that kind of vague, abstract nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still putting on an act ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's see how this ends for you !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Discard the superficial
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:29.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and return to the origin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by breaking the situation this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,can I subdue the enemy without fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and scare off Zhan Konglie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,He pointed him directly to the origin of the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu's Dao Heart cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,has actually advanced in an instant !?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:47.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man is definitely not Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,His cultivation is unfathomable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Lord's guidance
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,is like a second chance at life !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:53.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,understands now !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:56.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhan Konglie,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:57.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's fight again !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Zhan Konglie
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,didn't see clearly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,and offended Senior's cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg Senior for forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Brother Shengong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:11.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have found a wise master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:12.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,a tremendous fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have gotten a summon book from the Thunder Celestial Temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on, we shall serve as fellow messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:24.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Farewell !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I apologize for disturbing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's a summon book ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,summon books are communication tools from the Thunder Celestial Temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every candidate for becoming a messenger
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,gets one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:40.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 months before each opening of the Thunder Celestial Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,the candidates will compete with each other for the position
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,and fill the spots of the missing messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Zhan Konglie's cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,he should be able to secure a spot
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,if nothing goes wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:53.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shengong Hu being here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,may attract more unnecessary trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wish to go into seclusion for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,to comprehend an important spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a transmission jade slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:05.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Should my Lord need anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:07.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will come immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.36,0:19:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,contains a detailed map of the Southern Domain of Allheaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It may serve as a guide
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,for my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:34.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)\pos(148,435)}8 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 10 years of absorption,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Origin Soul is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no more room for origin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a cultivation bottleneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,To go any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must breakthrough to the second step.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.12,0:19:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that the 5 elements are complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,the bead has this Yin-Yang appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:01.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does it mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven Defying Bead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,what do you need
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,for your next step ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thankfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er and the others' souls are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:16.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,They seem even more stable than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Celestial Realm will open in 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The top priority
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to have a breakthrough in my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the Southern domain of Allheaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are many abandoned planets
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,with mortal settlements.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're perfect for concealing my tracks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and focusing on cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to settle somewhere soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:44.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I get my own cultivation planet in the Allheaven Star System.
Dialogue: 100,0:20:48.19,0:23:22.05,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,000)}Once their Dao Soul was controlled by someone else, although it wasn’t the same as death, their Dao Heart could be affected. The consequences had much longer-lasting significance.\NGiving his Dao Soul showed Shengong Hu’s sincerity!\N\N---\N\NLater in the episode, Wang Lin has a breakthrough in his understanding of thunder. It isn't explained in the donghua but in the novel it's said that Wang Lin had "vaguely seen" the law of thunder.\NUnderstanding laws is a fundamental part of being a second step cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.09,0:21:14.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.69,0:21:12.49,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1514,677)}Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:14.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with countless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.13,0:21:15.77,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,685)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:21.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:19.09,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,705)\fad(800,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:22.53,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:21.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:27.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.41,0:21:25.97,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:29.17,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:27.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}stand in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:34.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll defy the universe to tread the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:35.45,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1574,688)\fad(800,000)}Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:34.49,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}and ask this question to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:40.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:40.37,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:47.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
