Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:22:00.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.53,0:22:00.73,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:05.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
